description: Hedera Hashgraph & Scaffold-HBAR AI Context Rules
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx", "**/*.sol"]
rules:
  - "Always use Hedera JSON-RPC Relay URL (https://testnet.hashio.io/api) for EVM operations."
  - "Use Chain ID 296 for Hedera Testnet and Chain ID 295 for Hedera Mainnet."
  - "Prefer native HTS (@hashgraph/sdk) over EVM smart contracts for fungible/NFT creation to minimize transaction costs ($0.001 USD fixed fee)."
  - "Ensure all private keys are prefixed with '0x' when passing to Viem or Hardhat."
  - "When parsing contract events, fetch logs via Hashio RPC or Hedera Mirror Node REST APIs."